		(uuid "7440971c-3454-4e7f-9795-772f0f5bd47b")
	)
	(text "M14 (main power module): +12V_RAW from the main relay (B5/B6), +12V_IGN (D15), back-up +12V (B19).\nIt makes +12V, +5V and +5VAS, the protected sensor 5 V for throttle TPS, MAP and TGV sensors (C16).\nM8 (second power module) feeds only the pedal 5 V (APS_PS_5V, C15), so pedal and throttle sensors are on\nindependent rails and their plausibility check works. The open link puts the pedal on +5VAS if M8 is not fitted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a27ab323-74ba-49ca-bdc1-b724adc66624")
	)
